 "remarks": "Charming one-bedroom lower-level apartment in a quiet West Norwalk neighborhood. Features a comfortable living room, kitchen with dining area, spacious bedroom, and full bathroom with shower. The apartment has its own separate entrance and includes use of the washer and dryer, above-ground pool, and yard. Conveniently located close to shopping, restaurants, and major highways. One-car garage available for an additional $100 per month; otherwise, street parking is available. A great opportunity to enjoy a private, comfortable living space in a desirable location. All utilities, garbage, snow plowing and water included. Owner occupies the upper level of the home.",
